sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant GPU as GPU
    participant DCGM as DCGM exporter
    participant Prom as Metrics store
    participant Rule as Alert rules
    participant OC as On-call
    GPU->>DCGM: utilisation, memory, temperature, ECC errors
    DCGM->>Prom: scraped as metrics
    Note over DCGM,Prom: "GPU utilisation" means a kernel was resident — not that it was efficient
    Prom->>Rule: evaluate
    alt XID errors or falling clocks
        Rule->>OC: page — the hardware is degrading
    else utilisation high but throughput low
        Rule->>OC: ticket — probably starved on data or interconnect
    else memory climbing steadily
        Rule->>OC: ticket — a leak will end in an OOM kill
    end
    Note over Rule,OC: alert on tokens per second and queue depth, not just on the GPU being busy
